FUNCTION-POOL ZIMG.                         "MESSAGE-ID ..

TABLES: DRAW, TDWAT, TDWS, TDWD, TDWE, *TDWE, TDWP, TDWN, TDWX, *TDWD,
        DRAT, IFLO, EQKT, MAKT.

DATA: BEGIN OF INTDRAZ OCCURS 0.
        INCLUDE STRUCTURE DRAZ.
DATA: END OF INTDRAZ.

DATA: BEGIN OF IN_DELDRAD OCCURS 1.
        INCLUDE STRUCTURE DRAD.
DATA: END OF IN_DELDRAD.

DATA: BEGIN OF IN_INTDRAD OCCURS 1.
        INCLUDE STRUCTURE DRAD.
DATA: END OF IN_INTDRAD.

DATA: BEGIN OF IN_MRKDRAD OCCURS 1.
